            "title": "Example: Braces",
            "id": 127139,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaznacz kod należący do tych funkcji.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"func\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>{</code>, następnie <code>}</code>, a potem <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function",
            "id": 127140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego tworzymy funkcje?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aby grupować i ponownie wykorzystywać powiązany kod</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aby oddzielić powiązany kod</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aby ułatwić tworzenie zmiennych</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aby grupować i ponownie wykorzystywać powiązany kod.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 127141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co się dzieje, gdy wywołujemy funkcję w Swift?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kod wewnątrz funkcji jest wykonywany</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cały kod wewnątrz funkcji jest przechowywany w zmiennej</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pętla while jest tworzona wewnątrz funkcji</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kod wewnątrz funkcji jest wykonywany.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 127142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dokończ wywoływanie funkcji, wpisując jej nazwę.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(money, currency)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"100\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>displayCash</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 127143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code> w jednym wierszu, a <code>Dni w roku</code> w następnym</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code> w jednym wierszu, a <code>Dni w roku</code> w następnym.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 127144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest parametr w tej funkcji?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(text + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nie ma parametru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 127145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołaj funkcję i przekaż jej wartość.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(user: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"func\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>removeUser</code>, następnie <code>user:</code> i na końcu <code>\"Lisa\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
