            "id": 127151,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną <code>result</code> i zapisz w niej wynik wywołania funkcji z wartością.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Bool\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(number: \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>let</code>, następnie <code>result</code>, a potem <code>moreThanTen</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>"
